# Kutzil's Flanker, third mode: "Exile target player's graveyard." On turn 2 Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Ornithopter, so each
# player has a graveyard, then flashes in the Flanker and targets Bot2: Bot2's graveyard is exiled, Bot1's own
# (Black Lotus, Lightning Bolt) stays. Nothing left under Bot1's control, so the Flanker stays a 3/1 and gets no counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Kutzil's Flanker
Island x3
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

